{
  "bookId": "hero-214013",
  "id": "bond-26059",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26059001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "这间小屋是……主人送给我的礼物？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么样，会惊喜吗？算是给拉斐尔要送我的那副画的回礼哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "可是，我给主人的画……还没有画好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那是因为拉斐尔想要画出最好的我，所以才慢了些不是吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "不，我只是觉得，画的慢一点的话……就可以……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "拉斐尔的画，现在是什么进度了呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "现在……已经画好一大半了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我可以先看看吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "只要主人想看的话，当然可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "画的真不错，特别是这双眼睛，不多不少正好两个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "……？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哈哈，开个玩笑。拉斐尔画的真好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "对了，拉斐尔如果以后还想要我来做模特，还可以来找我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "……真的还可以吗……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26059015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
